# Test delete protection for builtins and keywords
# This test verifies that attempting to delete protected builtins or keywords raises N003 error

# Test 1: Try to delete a builtin function (type)
# Expected: N003 error - Cannot delete protected builtin/keyword 'type'
del type

# Test 2: Try to delete a keyword (if)
# Expected: N003 error - Cannot delete protected builtin/keyword 'if'
del if

# Test 3: Try to delete another builtin (say)
# Expected: N003 error - Cannot delete protected builtin/keyword 'say'
del say

# Test 4: Try to delete a loop control keyword (break)
# Expected: N003 error - Cannot delete protected builtin/keyword 'break'
del break

# Test 5: Verify normal deletion still works (user-defined variable)
x = 10
del x
# Expected: No error, x should be deleted successfully
